---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Our Process | Arethé Physis Studios">
	<main class="process-page">
		
		<header class="process-header">
			<span class="tagline">The Circular Journey</span>
			<h1>How we make <br/><span class="accent">the magic</span> happen.</h1>
			<p>We don't just make clothes. We rescue stories, deconstruct the past, and stitch it into the future.</p>
		</header>

		<section class="timeline">
			
			<div class="step-row">
				<div class="step-text">
					<span class="step-num">01</span>
					<h2>Source</h2>
					<p>We hunt for high-quality second-hand garments, deadstock fabrics, and textile waste that would otherwise end up in landfills. Every piece has a past.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="step-visual beige-blob">
					<span>[ V7-01 Source Illustration ]</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="step-row reverse">
				<div class="step-text">
					<span class="step-num">02</span>
					<h2>Transform</h2>
					<p>We deconstruct the garments, cut them up, and redesign them. We combine different textures and materials to give them a completely new life.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="step-visual turquoise-blob">ma
					<span>[ V7-02 Transform Illustration ]</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="step-row">
				<div class="step-text">
					<span class="step-num">03</span>
					<h2>Personalize</h2>
					<p>The final touch. We add custom patches, hand embroidery, and digital prints. You get a 1-of-1 piece that nobody else in the world owns.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="step-visual yellow-blob">
					<span>[ V7-03 Personalize Illustration ]</span>
				</div>
			</div>

		</section>

		<section class="process-cta">
			<h2>Ready to wear the change?</h2>
			<a href="/collection" class="btn">Explore the collection</a>
		</section>

	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.process-page { background-color: var(--blanco-roto); min-height: 100vh; padding-bottom: 8rem; }
	.process-header { text-align: center; padding: 8rem 2rem 6rem; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
	.tagline { display: block; font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--marron); opacity: 0.5; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
	.process-header h1 { font-size: 5rem; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -2px; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
	.accent { font-style: italic; color: var(--turquesa); }
	.process-header p { font-size: 1.2rem; opacity: 0.7; line-height: 1.6; }

	.timeline { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8rem; }
	.step-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 4rem; }
	.step-row.reverse .step-text { order: 2; }
	.step-row.reverse .step-visual { order: 1; }

	.step-num { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 2rem; color: var(--turquesa); font-weight: 600; display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
	.step-text h2 { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: -1px; }
	.step-text p { font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.8; }

	.step-visual {
		width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
		display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
		font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--marron); opacity: 0.6; text-align: center; padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 50% 60% 50%;
		animation: morph 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
	}
	.beige-blob { background-color: var(--beige); }
	.turquoise-blob { background-color: var(--turquesa); }
	.yellow-blob { background-color: var(--amarillo); }

	@keyframes morph {
		0% { border-radius: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 50% 60% 50%; }
		100% { border-radius: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 50% 60% 40% 50%; }
	}

	.process-cta { margin-top: 10rem; text-align: center; }
	.process-cta h2 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-style: italic; }
	.btn { display: inline-block; background-color: var(--marron); color: var(--blanco-roto); padding: 1.2rem 3rem; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; transition: all 0.3s; }
	.btn:hover { background-color: var(--turquesa); color: var(--marron); transform: translateY(-3px); }

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.process-header h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; }
		.step-row, .step-row.reverse { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; text-align: center; }
		.step-row.reverse .step-text { order: 1; }
		.step-row.reverse .step-visual { order: 2; }
		.step-visual { max-width: 300px; margin: 0 auto; }
	}
</style>